            {
              "id": "_rr7buugym",
              "name": "Internal Tools",
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "_aacdf5x77",
                  "title": "Payroll Migration Tool",
                  "link": "https://internalweb.greenshadesonline.com/syncs/payroll",
                  "desc": "This tool enables users to initiate a <b>Payroll Data Migration (PDM)</b> task.\r<div>\r</div><div>A PDM task is specifically designed for clients transitioning from Dynamics GP and requires the payroll module to be active within the workspace. The PDM process occurs after a standard upsync task has been completed and executes the necessary GoFetch operations to transfer payroll data into the payroll database.\r</div><div>\r</div><div>For Dynamics GP clients, please note that if a sync is executed on a workspace with the payroll module enabled, a PDM task will automatically be triggered following the completion of the upsync—regardless of whether this tool is used. This tool is intended to streamline the process by allowing users to initiate the task without requiring direct access to the workspace.\r</div><div>\r</div><div>It is also important to understand that a PDM task can only insert new records into the payroll database and cannot update existing ones. As a result, if a PDM task partially fails due to data or configuration issues, subsequent attempts may continue to fail even after those issues are resolved, as previously inserted records may be treated as duplicates.\r</div><div>\r</div><div>To avoid this, it is recommended to run a standard sync with the payroll module disabled and resolve any errors prior to activating payroll. Addressing sync issues in a production workspace will also prevent those same issues from occurring in a beta workspace, eliminating the need to run a sync in beta before enabling the payroll module.</div><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"screenshot\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\">",
                  "demoLink": "",
                  "config": "",
                  "inProgress": false,
                  "hiddenFields": [
                    "config",
                    "demo"
                  ],
                  "kbArticles": [
                    {
                      "name": "Payroll: Request BETA (or Test) Workspace and/or PDM",
                      "link": "https://greenshades.crm.dynamics.com/main.aspx?appid=1ec07c58-e95e-ea11-a811-000d3a37503c&forceUCI=1&pagetype=entityrecord&etn=knowledgearticle&id=7e811b70-adce-4fc6-b53e-7935b335dc07",
                      "type": "internal"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "Sync Portal: Issues with Payroll Data Migration (PDM)",
                      "link": "https://greenshades.crm.dynamics.com/main.aspx?appid=1ec07c58-e95e-ea11-a811-000d3a37503c&forceUCI=1&newWindow=true&pagetype=entityrecord&etn=knowledgearticle&id=099d1361-d638-43e8-bbbb-b0e9e2df83ba",
                      "type": "internal"
                    }
                  ],
                  "lastUpdated": "04/29/2026, 10:31:36 AM",
                  "perms": "This tool requires specific permissions to use - TPE/QA, Dev, <i>TBD</i>"
                }
              ]
            },
